lity that might attract an employer e.g. conscientious, adventurous, punctual, etc., and your career goals.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 After this comes the main part of your CV starting with education, then work experience. Use reverse chronological order to list these, starting wit\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 h what you\hich\f31506 
